# Fail-fast enforce list. Rename to .failfast.list at repo root and edit.
# One glob pattern per line, matched against repo-relative paths.
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Examples:
#   src/**/*.py                           # all Python under src
#   pipeline/*.py                         # only top-level Python in pipeline
#   migrations/*.sql                      # SQL migrations
#   config/runtime.json                   # specific config file
#
# Patterns use bash [[ == ]] glob matching. ** is enabled (globstar).

# Add your project-specific paths here:
